            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1391] When the EVCC wants to enter a standby period, after having received ChargeLoopRes, the EVCC shall send a PowerDeliveryReq with parameter ChargeProgress set to \"Standby\", while V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Timer is smaller than V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Time.",
            "block_bbox": [
